1. Scope
--------
This repository contains MATLAB, Python, and R source code developed by
Alexandre Matov for machine learning and deep learning classification
experiments (convolutional neural networks, transfer learning,
logistic/lasso regression, gradient boosting). The code depends on
third-party MATLAB toolboxes and Python/R packages that are NOT
included in this repository -- see DEPENDENCIES.md.

